                "source": "Hootsuite Inc.",
                "text": "MACE WIN: Check out this op-ed highlighting the $500K grant we helped secure for @USCBeaufort\u2019s nursing program!\n\n\u201cCongresswoman Nancy Mace is also aware of South Carolina\u2019s nursing crisis, and she helped secure the grant by submitting a letter of support to the Health Resources and Services Administration. In a highly competitive environment, being awarded this federal grant speaks volumes about the strength of USCB\u2019s nursing program and its commitment to community health.\u201d\n\n\u2014 Kimberly Dudas, Interim Provost and Executive Vice Chancellor for Academic Affairs, and Professor of Nursing at @USCBeaufort\n\nSouth Carolina faces one of the worst nurse shortages in the nation.  This investment will help train the next generation of nurses who will serve right here in the Lowcountry.",
