                "source": "Hootsuite Inc.",
                "text": "MACE WIN: We recently announced the University of South Carolina Beaufort\u2019s $3.87 million federal grant through the Health Resources and Services Administration to expand its nursing program.\n\nWe worked closely with the Health Resources and Services Administration to support this funding, including submitting a congressional letter of support from our office.\n\nSouth Carolina faces one of the worst nursing shortages in the country, with as many as one in five positions projected to go unfilled by 2036.\n\nThe funding will help train up to 64 new nurses each year, strengthen rural healthcare, and fill critical workforce gaps across the Lowcountry.",
