                "text": "Thank you Chief Camacho and the men and women of the North Charleston Police Department for handling a dangerous situation on the Don Holt Bridge with professionalism, patience, and compassion.\n\nFor hours, officers worked to de-escalate a mental health crisis and ultimately intervened to save a life. \n\nThis outcome didn\u2019t happen by chance\u2014it happened because of training, teamwork, and a commitment to preserving life.\n\nThis is what responsible, well-trained policing looks like. \n\nThank you to every officer, first responder, and crisis professional involved.",
